31957", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031465_222765495965290_212792495828102734_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I5BGvx0cJ0MQ7kNvwFglekv&_nc_oc=AdlYmST0iHFUMx3dW4rLMCEOf-lKWEGnjKSR_JfNtxtUn_RQnrJs9Dot7iqvDPNtwJo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuAJ7OH0G-R0m81rwR3fNyU2Bu4xi47bKenKk5ujYOG3Q&oe=699EF74F"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "169433328311430", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982653_169433331644763_6500055822036622297_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v-BqxkUbboQQ7kNvwEpBTSJ&_nc_oc=AdnpHLFWsY3c9xggBsy3ol-kuVEBgkt-f8lSvoce0wzQVG2oUkM58eMA7r3JsxiEwL0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu6W564h620wWLOZVKgEdCj_U6sxRK-4EWzJGebYAMayQ&oe=699EDF18"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover image.png", "id": "117521453594753", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974535_117521456928086_99350484779883293_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rfF55MraNKUQ7kNvwFcQenJ&_nc_oc=AdnpdCijTmgxI3ddYahxJO5XXYHGeqNOh8-6I9KVzQGSrLKLyDuGK5pv_Nd5dfDjgyw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvEDM8gjsNyzMT4hp8FC99gYraNVgNAROC5shLtl4xJPQ&oe=699ED94C"}, "display_name": "SENTIO VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "SENTIO VR is the preferred platform for professionals working in the Architecture, Engineering & Construction Industry in 100+ countries. How does a project that has not yet been built look like? Instead of reviewing 2D floorplans, renders & video walkthroughs - SENTIO VR customers put on an Oculus Quest headset for real-time feedback with clients, improved designs & win new projects.\n\nHere are the key features that make SENTIO VR stand out:\n\n1) Plugins for SketchUp & Autodesk Revit\n- No downloads or upload of files needed. Works with your existing design tools\n\n2) No additional downloads\n- No additional PC software is required to manage the model upload 